    termsFull: "### 1. General\nDIGICAP® is provided as a professional tool for statistical analysis and capability studies within industrial production environments.\n\n### 2. User Responsibility\nIt is the user's responsibility to ensure that collected measurement data is accurate and that the selected statistical models are appropriate for the specific process being analyzed.\n\n### 3. Limitation of Liability\nMI Qvalitetsutbildningar AB shall under no circumstances be held liable for economic losses, production downtime, or quality issues arising from decisions based on analyses performed within this application.",
    privacyFull: "### 1. Local Data Processing\nDIGICAP® prioritizes your privacy. No measurement data or study information is ever transmitted to our servers. All data is stored exclusively locally within your browser's session memory.\n\n### 2. GDPR and Confidentiality\nSince no personally identifiable information is stored centrally, the application is fully compliant with strict security requirements. Each browser tab operates as a closed environment; data is not shared between tabs.",
